      "value": "I want to meantion that i wrote \"after disconnect\" because i got a disconnect popup but i actually couldn't find any indicator that i had any disconnect on my side. I didn't had any disconnect in any other program. My router and my ISP telling me that i didn't had any disconnect for 10 days. In this 10 days i had 4 of this disconnects where i was forced to close VRChat to be able to join anybody.\n\nBefore it was like this it was a bit buggy with the reconnectiong but i could at least go back to my home world without restarting my game. (Or join a friend if i ended in the error world)",
